// A drum machine's kick in the 909 style (section 7f, rung E4): a sine whose pitch an envelope with an
// instant attack sweeps down from about three times the note, shaped and pushed into saturation, with
// a click of low-passed noise at the strike ("Practical Bass Drum Synthesis", Sound On Sound, February
// 2002: the 909's oscillator pitch set by a contour with an "instant Attack and slow Decay", a
// waveshaper, and noise and a short pulse for the click). The punch of house.
Instrument(
    id: "kick_909",
    words: "music.instrument.kick_909",
    kind: DrumMachine((
        tones: [(decay_s: 0.4, pitch: 3.2, pitch_s: 0.022)],
        drive: 0.3,
        click: 0.3,
        click_ms: 2.5,
    )),
    level_db: -12.5,
    reverb_send: 0.03,
)
